Z||000000||Fleabitdog||09-08-2001||11:22 PM||||I pulled a set of blue springs off an 87GT today. Is there any way I can measure them to determine if they are lowering springs and if so how much they should lower the car?<BR>I know lowering springs have been discussed alot, I did a search but I could not find an answer to my question. Thanks  Dave||||reg||1
Z||000001||terryk||09-08-2001||11:29 PM||||Most likely Suspension Techniques. Light baby blue. They make black ones too. Same lowering distance.<P>Eibachs are marked with their name.||||reg||1
